    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32982" root="فتن" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْتُونَةٌ</span></b>  is [a term] applied to <i>A number of black
camels collected together</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَابَة سَوْدَآء</span>), as though
they were like the [stony tract called] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَّة</span>, in
blackness; as though they were burnt. (T.)

